{
 "name": "La Calabaza",
 "rev": 2,
 "about": "Pickle, Jam's band leader, leads a night parade with a glowing pumpkin (la calabaza), Praline on the maracas and Sesame on the drum (Mochi tags along with a cowbell). La Calabaza track is our own guaracha-style instrumental made in the app with ACE-Step 1.5 (its music runs 13 s; the part stops where it does). Every shot is a still picture of our cast (Codex's GPT Image, from their pictures) moved with ffmpeg: animated stills, not footage; Roll a shot with LTX-2.5 to make it real. A cut on every bar Jam's finder heard (the bar line set on the kick), faster cuts in the last bars, our own call-outs as bold stacked captions, a zoom on every beat, a flash on every bar, a shake on ¡Vamos! and a colour hit at the end. The film is the edit as the app exports it.",
